# Clip Mate is a local Python app. Vercel only hosts the front end, so keep
# every Python and media file out of the upload. Otherwise Vercel detects
# requirements.txt / pyproject.toml, builds a Python function, and blows
# past the 500 MB function limit.
backend
data
requirements.txt
pyproject.toml
run.bat
run.sh
.env
.env.example
README.md
package-lock.json
package.json
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.py
